  "reasoning": "The facts describe three distinct criminal behaviors: (1) the defendant accepted large sums of money and valuables in exchange for using his official position, which constitutes the crime of receiving bribes (受贿). (2) He diverted public funds from a state-owned enterprise to a private individual without proper authorization, which is the crime of embezzling public funds (挪用公款). (3) His personal assets far exceed his legitimate income and a substantial portion cannot be explained, meeting the criteria for the offense of having unexplained huge assets (巨额财产来源不明). Therefore, all three charges apply.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]受贿;挪用公款;巨额财产来源不明<eoa>"
